cli-help-analyze-5 = --points FILE  Writes the torque-speed points of each motor.
cli-help-analyze-6 = --breakdown FILE  Writes peak and RMS of each part of each motor's torque.
cli-help-analyze-7 = --budget FILE  Writes where the energy drawn from the supply went.
